  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TextController
  messages:
  - I'm not going to lie to you...
  - This is the furthest I've ever got.
  - I couldn't keep control of the balls so I kept blowing myself up to reset the
    rooms.
  - We can't enter those weird-looking openings in the fences.
  - Looks like it kills anything that's alive...
  - Good luck brochacho...
